 href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Desecrated_Temple_of_Vol_(epic)\" title=\"Desecrated Temple of Vol (epic)\">Desecrated Temple of Vol (epic)</a></b>, end chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +11</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +11</a>:</b> Passive: +11 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Speed\" title=\"Speed\">Speed XV</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Speed\" title=\"Speed\">Speed XV</a>:</b> Passive: +30% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Run_speed\" title=\"Run speed\">movement speed</a>, +15% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to melee and ranged attack speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vertigo_(enchantment)\" title=\"Vertigo (enchantment)\"> Vertigo +12</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vertigo_(enchantment)\" title=\"Vertigo (enchantment)\"> Vertigo +12</a>:</b> This effect gives a +12 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to the DC to resist the character's <a href=\"/page/Trip\" title=\"Trip\">Trip</a> and <a href=\"/page/Improved_Trip\" title=\"Improved Trip\">Improved Trip</a> attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +12</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +12</a>:</b> +12 Enhancement bonus to the DC of character's Stunning Blow and Stunning Fist attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +12</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +12</a></b>: This effect gives a +12 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to the DC to resist the character's <a href=\"/page/Sunder\" title=\"Sunder\">Sunder</a> and <a href=\"/page/Improved_Sunder\" title=\"Improved Sunder\">Improved Sunder</a> attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heroism_(enchantment)\" title=\"Heroism (enchantment)\">Greater Heroism</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Heroism_(enchantment)\" title=\"Heroism (enchantment)\"><b>Greater Heroism:</b></a> Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Morale_bonus\" title=\"Morale bonus\">morale bonus</a> to all your <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack rolls</a>, <a href=\"/page/Saving_throw\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throws</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Skill_check\" title=\"Skill check\">skill checks</a>. Does not grant immunity to <a href=\"/page/Fear\" title=\"Fear\">Fear</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">Upgradeable - Primary Augment<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Upgradeable - Primary Augment:</b> This item can be upgraded to contain a Yellow, Blue or Red (weapons and shields only) augment. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a> outside the Black Mausoleum and combine it with <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Tapestry_Shred\" title=\"Item:Epic Tapestry Shred\">Item:Epic Tapestry Shreds</a> to upgrade the item.</span></span> (<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8